      "message": "You should take these values from [DTS](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/main/dts/arm/st/f4/stm32f4.dtsi#L515) using `STM32_DT_INST_CLOCKS()` macro (or `STM32_CLOCK_INFO()` if only APB1 clock should be disabled), instead of providing register and bit here.\n\nUnfortunately, the bit in DTS is different. According to the reference manual (RM0402 Rev 6 6.3.13) your version is correct.\n\nHave you considered disabling LSI clock?",
